Third-party software

This project uses the ONVIF Media Signing Framework as an upstream
dependency (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 ONVIF). Upstream sources are fetched
separately and are not vendored into this repository by default. See
docs/upstream-media-signing.md and third_party/README.md.

The signing artifact writer and integration adapter use nlohmann JSON
(MIT License, Copyright (c) 2013-2022 Niels Lohmann), supplied as an external
build dependency and not
vendored into this repository.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The optional live ingest dynamically links GStreamer core/app/RTP (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
and uses LGPL RTSP/RTP plugins. GStreamer is not vendored. OpenSSL 3.x is an
external dependency under Apache-2.0. The Python Agent uses external MCP and
Pydantic packages under MIT. Preserve applicable third-party notices when
redistributing dependencies; this repository does not bundle their binaries.
